## Troubleshooting Reference

| Error / Symptom | Cause | Solution |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **`bash: claude: command not found`** | Git Bash PATH is missing the global npm directory. | Add `export PATH="$PATH:$APPDATA/npm"` to `~/.bashrc` and restart VSCode. |
| **`System message must be at the beginning`** | Mid-chat system messages triggered Jinja template guardrails. | Apply Step 1 patch and **restart the ExLlama server process**. |
| **`404 /v1/responses`** | LiteLLM attempted to hit modern OpenAI endpoints unsupported by local engines. | Ensure `model` uses the `custom_openai/` prefix in `litellm_config.yaml`. |
| **`500 Internal Server Error`** | ExLlama received unsupported JSON body parameters. | Enable `drop_params: true` in `litellm_config.yaml`. |
| **Prompted for browser sign-in on startup** | First-run onboarding wizard defaulting to web OAuth. | Run `echo '{"hasCompletedOnboarding": true}' > ~/.claude.json`. |
| **`HEAD /api/hello 404`** | Connection-warming latency probe sent by Claude Code at startup. | **Safe to ignore.** LiteLLM does not implement this endpoint, but core functionality is unaffected. |
